To generate the appropriate assert statement for the given comment, we need to ensure that after adding all elements from the collection `c` to the list, the list contains exactly the same elements as the collection `c`. Since the order of elements is preserved, we can compare the size of the list and the elements at each index.

Here is the assert statement:

<code>assert !c.isEmpty() => (\forall int i; 0 <= i && i < c.size(); this.get(i).equals(c.toArray()[i]));</code>

